{"title":"Career roadmap — GST Executive","role":"GST Executive","summary":"A GST Executive handles GST-related compliance, reconciliations, return preparation, tax documentation, input tax credit (ITC) review, notices, and coordination with finance/accounts teams. The role is especially relevant in accounting firms, corporates, tax consultancies, and shared-service centres.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"B.Com – Taxation"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest route is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Accounting","GST fundamentals","GST returns","Reconciliation","Tax compliance","ERP","Tax analytics","GST advisory"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","What to focus on"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"GST fundamentals, accounting, Excel, GST returns, ITC, e-invoicing, e-way bills, Tally/ERP"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"GST reconciliation, notices, assessments, audits, tax technology, multi-state compliance"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Tax analytics, automation, indirect-tax advisory, process optimisation"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"AI-assisted tax compliance, continuous tax monitoring, digital GST systems and strategic tax technology"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Accounting + taxation foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial accounting"},{"text":"Journal entries"},{"text":"Ledgers"},{"text":"Trial balance"},{"text":"Profit & Loss"},{"text":"Balance Sheet"},{"text":"Bank reconciliation"},{"text":"Accounts receivable/payable"},{"text":"Basic taxation concepts"},{"text":"Direct vs indirect taxes"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand GST fundamentals:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CGST"},{"text":"SGST"},{"text":"IGST"},{"text":"UTGST"},{"text":"GST regis