 of transactions will have a significant advantage over someone limited to manual return preparation."},{"type":"h","text":"4. ERP & Tax Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SAP"},{"text":"Oracle"},{"text":"Microsoft Dynamics"},{"text":"ERP tax modules"},{"text":"E-invoicing systems"},{"text":"API integrations"},{"text":"Tax automation platforms"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The future tax professional will increasingly work between finance, technology and compliance teams."},{"type":"note","label":"2040–2046","text":"How the role evolves"},{"type":"p","text":"Traditional:"},{"type":"flow","items":["GST Executive","Prepare returns","Reconcile data","File compliance"]},{"type":"p","text":"Future:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Tax Technology & Compliance Professional","Monitor transactions","Detect anomalies","Validate automated tax decisions","Manage exceptions","Advise the business"]},{"type":"p","text":"The role increasingly combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Tax","Accounting","Data","ERP","AI","Compliance"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended final skill stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Accounting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial Accounting"},{"text":"Cost Accounting"},{"text":"Financial Statements"},{"text":"Bookkeeping"},{"text":"Reconciliation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"GST"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GST Registration"},{"text":"GST Returns"},{"text":"ITC"},{"text":"Reverse Charge"},{"text":"E-Invoicing"},{"text":"E-Way Bills"},{"text":"GST Reconciliation"},{"text":"GST Audit"},{"text":"GST Notices"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Taxation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Income Tax basics"},{"text":"TDS"},{"text":"Tax Deductibility"},{"text":"Tax Documentation"},{"text":"Indirect Tax"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"TallyPrime"},{"text":"SAP/ERP"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tax research"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Attention to detail"},{"text":"Compliance management"},{"text":"Client communication"},{"text":"Analytical thinking"},{"text":"Tax-risk identification"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target progression"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com Taxation","Accounting","Excel","GST Fundamentals"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2"},{"type":"flow","items":["GST Returns","ITC","Tally","E-Invoicing","Reconciliation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3"},{"type":"flow","items":["Advanced GST","Power Query","Power BI","ERP"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Final Year"},{"type":"p","text":"GST Internship + Reconciliation/Tax Analytics Projects"},{"type":"h","text":"0–2 years"},{"type":"p","text":"GST Executive / Tax Associate"},{"type":"h","text":"2–5 years"},{"type":"p","text":"Senior GST Executive / Tax Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"5–8 years"},{"type":"p","text":"GST Manager / Indirect Tax Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"8–12+ years"},{"type":"p","text":"Head of Tax / Tax Director / Tax Advisory Partner"},{"type":"h","text":"Best employability combination"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com Taxation","GST practical knowledge","Advanced Excel","Tally/ERP","GST reconciliation","Power Query","Power BI","tax research","internship","CA/CMA/ACCA pathway."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For the long term, the strongest profile is GST expertise + ERP + data analytics + automation + tax judgement, rather than simply knowing how to file GST returns."}]}]}